I'm really grateful for all the video letters from everyone. I'll treasure them like family heirlooms. Thank you so much!

479
00:47:30,572 --> 00:47:34,572
それではですね 次は告知になります！どうぞ！
Now then, next up we have announcements! Here you go!

480
00:47:36,572 --> 00:47:38,872
皆さん こんにちはわん！
Hello everyone-wan!

481
00:47:39,072 --> 00:47:40,872
周防パトラです！
It's Suou Patra!

482
00:47:41,072 --> 00:47:44,272
パトダイレクトをご覧いただき ありがとうございます！
Thank you for watching PatDirect!

483
00:47:44,572 --> 00:47:48,072
今日は 全部で4つの告知があります！
Today, we have four announcements in total!

484
00:47:48,572 --> 00:47:52,572
それではまず こちらの告知をご覧ください！
First off, please take a look at this announcement!

485
00:48:09,272 --> 00:48:12,272
ねぇ 心試してみてよ 狂う夢の...
Hey, try testing my heart, in a maddening dream...

486
00:48:14,072 --> 00:48:16,072
KONAMI

487
00:48:17,072 --> 00:48:26,572
この度 アミューズメント施設向けの音楽ゲーム『GITADORA』シリーズのArena Model筐体にて 楽曲収録することになりました！
My song will be included in the Arena Model cabinets of the "GITADORA" arcade game series!

488
00:48:27,072 --> 00:48:30,072
なんと曲は 『メタルラブ・メソッド』！
And the song is "Metal Love Method"!

489
00:48:30,572 --> 00:48:34,572
BEMANI Sound Team "あさき"さんとダブルギター！
It's a double guitar track with BEMANI Sound Team's "Asaki"!

490
00:48:35,072 --> 00:48:39,072
このライブが終わったあと ゲーム内で誰でもプレイできるようになります！
After this live stream ends, anyone will be able to play it in the game!

491
00:48:39,572 --> 00:48:44,072
ゲーム内の「GALAXY WAVE DELTA」カテゴリーから選曲してみてね！
Try selecting it from the "GALAXY WAVE DELTA" category in the game!

492
00:48:44,572 --> 00:48:50,572
初めてGITADORAをプレイするよという人は ルーキーモードでぜひプレイしてみてください！
If it's your first time playing GITADORA, please try playing it in Rookie Mode!

493
00:48:51,072 --> 00:48:58,572
また 19時からKONAMI公式YouTubeチャンネルから この楽曲のフルバージョンもアップロード予定！
Also, starting at 19:00, the full version of this song will be uploaded to KONAMI's official YouTube channel!

494
00:48:58,872 --> 00:49:01,872
皆さん ぜひGITADORAで遊んでみてね！
Everyone, please be sure to give it a try on GITADORA!

495
00:49:02,272 --> 00:49:05,072
やったー！ついに発表！
Hooray! Finally, the announcement!

496
00:49:05,572 --> 00:49:11,072
周防パトラフィギュア第2弾が登場いたします！
The second Suou Patra scale figure is coming!

497
00:49:12,072 --> 00:49:21,072
今回のテーマは ASMR配信の世界観を詰め込んだ 周防パトラ監修の完全オリジナルポーズ！
This time's theme features an all-original pose supervised by Suou Patra, packed with the atmosphere of ASMR streams!

498
00:49:21,572 --> 00:49:25,572
髪の毛は透明パーツで毛先まで美しく！
Clear parts are used for the hair, making it look beautiful all the way to the tips!

499
00:49:25,872 --> 00:49:30,872
お洋服のツヤ感 チョーカーやベルトの金具まで忠実に再現！
The glossy finish of her clothes, choker, and belt buckles are all faithfully recreated!

500
00:49:31,072 --> 00:49:35,072
おへそ周りのシースルーは…はぁ ため息もの！
The see-through fabric around her navel... sigh, it's breathtaking!

501
00:49:36,072 --> 00:49:41,572
お尻 胸 足裏まで 職人技で丁寧に仕上げました！
From her bottom and chest to the soles of her feet, it's meticulously crafted with master skill!

502
00:49:42,072 --> 00:49:46,072
耳かきやクッション ラグマットも超可愛い！
The earpick, cushion, and rug mat are also super cute!

503
00:49:46,272 --> 00:49:49,072
クッションにはパトラのサイン入りだよ！
The cushion even features Patra's signature!

504
00:49:49,572 --> 00:49:54,572
そして 気分で楽しめる表情差し替えパーツ付き！
Plus, it comes with interchangeable face parts to match your mood!

505
00:49:55,072 --> 00:49:58,072
ぎゅっとこだわりが詰まったフィギュア 楽しんでね！
Please enjoy this figure packed with so much attention to detail!

506
00:50:00,080 --> 00:50:01,880
15日から開始です
Preorders start on the 15th!

507
00:50:02,380 --> 00:50:06,080
予約締め切りは10月17日までだよ
Preorders close on October 17th!

508
00:50:06,580 --> 00:50:09,580
絶対ゲットしてね
Be sure to get yours!

509
00:50:11,880 --> 00:50:17,980
はぁ... パトラちゃん、お腹が空いて力が出ないよー
Phew... Patra-chan, I'm so hungry I have no energy~

510
00:50:18,580 --> 00:50:24,280
そんな時はこれ！手作り風UMEE!パトラのカニカマカレー！
When that happens, try this! Homemade-style UMEE! Patra's Crab Stick Curry!

511
00:50:25,280 --> 00:50:30,580
ピリッとスパイスのきいたカレーにカニカマがごろごろ！UMEE!
Spicy curry packed with big chunks of crab sticks! UMEE!

512
00:50:33,280 --> 00:50:36,580
うわー！グラシャス！ギリギリOKだね！
Woah! Delicious! Barely made it!

513
00:50:36,880 --> 00:50:43,780
ついに出た！周防パトラ全面監修！手作り風UMEE!パトラのカニカマカレー！
Finally here! Fully supervised by Suou Patra! Homemade-style UMEE! Patra's Crab Stick Curry!

514
00:50:44,280 --> 00:50:47,580
2025年10月1日発売！
Releasing October 1, 2025!

515
00:50:47,980 --> 00:50:49,880
1箱に2食入り！
2 servings per box!

516
00:50:50,080 --> 00:50:54,480
パトラのオリジナルカードが全6種類1枚入りだよ！
Includes 1 of 6 all-new original Patra cards!

517
00:50:54,880 --> 00:51:00,680
そしてなんと！パトラのUMEE皿＆パトラのUMAIスプーンセット発売だよ！
And what's more! Patra's UMEE Plate & UMAI Spoon Set is also on sale!

518
00:51:01,080 --> 00:51:04,280
スプーンはパトラがイラストを描いたよ！
Patra drew the illustration on the spoon!

519
00:51:05,580 --> 00:51:09,680
栄養満点！パトラの愛情も満点だよ！
Full of nutrition! Full of Patra's love too!

520
00:51:10,880 --> 00:51:13,880
詳細をまたXなどで知らせるね！
I'll announce more details on X and elsewhere!

521
00:51:14,280 --> 00:51:16,880
楽しみにしててね！
Look forward to it!

522
00:51:18,880 --> 00:51:23,080
全部で3つの告知をご覧いただきありがとうございます！
Thank you for watching all three announcements!

523
00:51:23,580 --> 00:51:30,280
GITADORA、カレー、それからフリューさんでは第2弾のフィギュアが出ることになりました！
GITADORA, the curry, and then FuRyu announced a 2nd figure coming out!

524
00:51:30,880 --> 00:51:32,480
楽しみですね！
How exciting!

525
00:51:33,080 --> 00:51:36,580
それでは、次で最後の告知です！ご覧ください！
Now, here is our final announcement! Please take a look!

526
00:51:43,280 --> 00:51:49,580
「周防パトラ……？って、だれ？」
"Suou Patra...? Wait, who's that?"

527
00:52:08,580 --> 00:52:14,580
記憶をなくしたパトラと君が織りなすもしもの物語
A "what-if" story woven by you and a Patra who lost her memories.

528
00:52:15,280 --> 00:52:21,080
恋愛アドベンチャーゲーム「君色パトラIF」制作決定！
Romance Adventure Game "Kimi Iro Patra IF" in production!

529
00:52:24,580 --> 00:52:28,280
「パトラのこと、拾ってくれますか？」
"Will you pick Patra up...?"

530
00:52:31,880 --> 00:52:36,080
はい！ということで盛りだくさんの告知でしたー！
Alright! So those were a lot of announcements!

531
00:52:36,280 --> 00:52:38,280
みんなびっくりしたー？
Did everyone get surprised?

532
00:52:38,880 --> 00:52:44,280
後でね、Xの方にも情報を出しますのでよろしくお願いします！
I'll post details on X later, so please check it out!

533
00:52:45,080 --> 00:52:52,080
そしてね、ここまでたくさん歌ったんですけど、次でラストの曲になります！
And also, I've sung a lot up until now, but next will be the last song!

534
00:52:53,080 --> 00:52:56,880
おー！コメントもたくさんありがとうございます！
Ooh! Thank you so much for all the comments!

535
00:52:57,080 --> 00:53:08,280
いやーね、今年もこうしてね、新3Dが出せたり、あの、素敵なステージでライブができたのは
Man, being able to reveal a new 3D model like this year and perform live on such a wonderful stage...

536
00:53:08,380 --> 00:53:12,680
応援してくれてるみんなのおかげです！今日もね、ハッシュタグでたくさんつぶやいてくれてどうもありがとう！
...is all thanks to everyone supporting me! Thank you so much for tweeting a lot on the hashtag today as well!

537
00:53:13,080 --> 00:53:22,580
そしてそして！本日のステージを作ってくださいました、ブライブグループの皆さん！本当にありがとうございました！
And also! To everyone at Brave Group who created today's stage, thank you so very much!

538
00:53:23,080 --> 00:53:35,280
すごいんだよ！パトラがね、あの、パ...パンツっつった、あの、スカートの中ね、よく見せちゃうのでね、今日ね素敵なアングルを考えて撮ってくれました！本当にありがとうございます！
It's amazing! Because Patra often... shows under her skirt, they thought of such wonderful angles to shoot today! Thank you so much!

539
00:53:36,080 --> 00:53:43,280
はい！それでは！次の曲、なんと新曲になります！
Alright! Now then! The next song is actually... a brand new song!

540
00:53:44,080 --> 00:53:46,680
ぜひ聴いてください！
Please listen to it!

541
00:53:46,880 --> 00:53:51,280
新曲は、『MINNA~!』
The new song is "MINNA~!"

542
00:54:00,080 --> 00:54:05,080
MINNA~!

543
00:54:05,180 --> 00:54:07,480
みんなは噛めば噛むほど味が出るもの知ってる？
Do you know what gets tastier the more you chew it?

544
00:54:07,580 --> 00:54:11,480
人類の常識を超えて歴史を刻むもの教えてあげるね
Let me teach you what transcends human common sense and carves history!

545
00:54:11,880 --> 00:54:14,280
MINNA! MINNA! MINNA! MINNA!

546
00:54:15,080 --> 00:54:16,880
ゲームするよ！
Let's play games!

547
00:54:17,080 --> 00:54:20,580
MINNA! MINNA! MINNA! MINNA!

548
00:54:20,680 --> 00:54:21,880
声出していこう！
Let's hear your voices!

549
00:54:22,080 --> 00:54:25,880
気がついたら24時間ゲームばかりしてる
Before I knew it, I've been playing games for 24 hours straight

550
00:54:26,080 --> 00:54:28,480
現実？ 幻？ 夢の中？
Reality? Illusion? Inside a dream?

551
00:54:28,580 --> 00:54:31,080
どういうわけかやめられない
For some reason I just can't stop

552
00:54:31,280 --> 00:54:35,680
詰まり デバグを引いて最初からやり直し（爆破）
Getting stuck, running into bugs, resetting from the start (explosion!)

553
00:54:36,080 --> 00:54:40,880
沼の中 画面の前とやめられない
Stuck in a rut, in front of the screen, I just can't stop

554
00:54:40,980 --> 00:54:43,480
昔の昔の黒歴史
Dark history from long, long ago

555
00:54:43,580 --> 00:54:45,080
絶対誰でもあるよ（あるよー！あるよー！）
Everyone definitely has one! (We do! We do!)

556
00:54:45,280 --> 00:54:49,880
デバグちゃんどうしたのかななんて楽しい物語救い未来
Wondering what happened to Debug-chan, what a fun story, saving the future!

557
00:54:50,080 --> 00:54:52,580
あの一生懸命には意味がある
That hard effort was meaningful!

558
00:54:52,680 --> 00:54:54,980
パトラはいっぱいいます！
There are lots of Patras!

559
00:54:55,280 --> 00:55:00,080
みんなみんなみんな叫べ！バグがあってもプロデュース！
Everyone, everyone, everyone shout! Producing even through bugs!

560
00:55:00,088 --> 00:55:01,288
けれども
But still,

561
00:55:01,288 --> 00:55:02,588
クソゲーなんて
there's no such thing as a trash game

562
00:55:02,588 --> 00:55:03,888
この世にない
in this world!

563
00:55:03,888 --> 00:55:05,188
クリアして笑って
I'll beat the game, laugh,

564
00:55:05,188 --> 00:55:06,488
やるんだ
and show everyone!

565
00:55:06,488 --> 00:55:07,888
君の隣
By your side,

566
00:55:07,888 --> 00:55:09,688
きっと痛みも知ってるんだろう
you surely know the pain too, right?

567
00:55:09,688 --> 00:55:10,988
ダサいのにね
Even though it looks uncool,

568
00:55:10,988 --> 00:55:13,288
うらやましい
I envy it.

569
00:55:13,288 --> 00:55:14,588
そんな風に
Living like that,

570
00:55:14,588 --> 00:55:16,088
生きてみたいんだ
I want to try living like that.

571
00:55:16,188 --> 00:55:19,488
いいな いいな いいな...
So nice, so nice, so nice...

572
00:55:19,488 --> 00:55:22,888
いいな いいな いいな...
So nice, so nice, so nice...

573
00:55:22,888 --> 00:55:26,188
いいな いいな いいな...
So nice, so nice, so nice...

574
00:55:26,188 --> 00:55:29,888
いいな いいな いいな...
So nice, so nice, so nice...

575
00:55:29,888 --> 00:55:31,488
気がついたらみんな
Before I realized it, everyone...

576
00:55:31,488 --> 00:55:34,288
みんなと指かけたりしてる
everyone is linking pinkies with each other.

577
00:55:34,288 --> 00:55:36,588
神ゲー レアゲー クソゲー
God games, rare games, trash games...

578
00:55:36,588 --> 00:55:39,188
好奇心は止められない
Curiosity can't be stopped.

579
00:55:39,188 --> 00:55:41,388
良いことも悪いことも
Both good things and bad things...

580
00:55:41,388 --> 00:55:44,888
君の人生の味方になーれ
May they all become allies in your life!

581
00:55:45,088 --> 00:55:47,488
みんな泣きな
Everyone, cry out!

582
00:55:47,488 --> 00:55:48,488
みんな叫べ
Everyone, shout out!

583
00:55:48,488 --> 00:55:49,688
ゲームオーバー
Game Over...

584
00:55:49,688 --> 00:55:52,388
またリトライすればいい
Just retry again!

585
00:55:52,388 --> 00:55:54,688
諦められない
I can't give up

586
00:55:54,688 --> 00:55:57,188
ここらのゲーム
on these games here.

587
00:55:57,188 --> 00:55:59,688
ハッピーエンドに行くんだ
I'm heading for a happy ending!

588
00:55:59,688 --> 00:56:01,388
どこにも行かない
Going nowhere else,

589
00:56:01,388 --> 00:56:03,088
夜空だけが
only the night sky

590
00:56:03,088 --> 00:56:04,688
主役じゃないよね
isn't the main character, right?

591
00:56:04,688 --> 00:56:06,888
汗をぬぐって キラキラ
Wiping sweat, sparkling!

592
00:56:06,888 --> 00:56:09,688
悲しいときには泣けば
When you're sad, if you just cry,

593
00:56:09,688 --> 00:56:12,188
いいんだよ
it's okay!

594
00:56:14,288 --> 00:56:17,488
なんで苦しいことしてるんですか？
Why are you doing something so painful?

595
00:56:17,488 --> 00:56:20,188
もうゴールしてもいいのかな？
Is it okay if I reach the goal now?

596
00:56:20,188 --> 00:56:21,888
いやいや
No, no...

597
00:56:21,888 --> 00:56:25,088
思いを込めたもののすべてを見届けたい
I want to see through everything put into these thoughts,

598
00:56:25,088 --> 00:56:28,088
そんな行方が見たいだけ！
I just want to see how it turns out!

599
00:56:31,088 --> 00:56:33,488
みんなみんな
Everyone, everyone

600
00:56:33,488 --> 00:56:35,888
不安なんだよ
is anxious

601
00:56:35,888 --> 00:56:38,288
世の中にね
in this world.

602
00:56:38,288 --> 00:56:40,488
自分のこと
Is there anyone who...

603
00:56:40,488 --> 00:56:43,988
許してくれる人がいるのかな？
...will forgive me?

604
00:56:43,988 --> 00:56:47,388
挑戦できたら優勝！
If you can take on the challenge, you win!

605
00:56:47,388 --> 00:56:48,588
みんな泣きな
Everyone, cry out!

606
00:56:48,588 --> 00:56:49,788
みんな叫べ
Everyone, shout!

607
00:56:49,788 --> 00:56:51,088
意味があって
There's a meaning to it,

608
00:56:51,088 --> 00:56:52,388
ふりだしだけど
even if it's back to square one.

609
00:56:52,388 --> 00:56:53,688
けれども
But still,

610
00:56:53,688 --> 00:56:54,988
クソゲーなんて
there's no such thing as a trash game

611
00:56:54,988 --> 00:56:56,288
この世にない
in this world!

612
00:56:56,288 --> 00:56:57,688
クリアしてみせて
I'll clear it and show you,

613
00:56:57,688 --> 00:56:59,088
笑ってやるんだ
and laugh!

614
00:57:04,288 --> 00:57:07,888
はーい！お疲れ様でしたー！
Yay! Thank you for watching!

615
00:57:07,888 --> 00:57:11,388
ね、あ、かにかまもいてくれたの？
Ah, Kanikama was here too?

616
00:57:11,388 --> 00:57:13,588
どうもお疲れ様でした。
Thank you so much for your hard work!

617
00:57:13,588 --> 00:57:15,588
いや今日はね、あ、
So today, ah...

618
00:57:15,588 --> 00:57:20,188
みんなー！みんなー！みんなー！終わったよー！
Everyone! Everyone! Everyone! It's finished!

619
00:57:20,188 --> 00:57:22,088
今日はね、あの、
Today, um...

620
00:57:22,088 --> 00:57:26,588
なんと前回と同じステージと思いつつ、
Believe it or not, while it looks like the same stage as last time,

621
00:57:26,588 --> 00:57:29,488
ちょっとね、変化があるんですよ。
there are actually a few changes.

622
00:57:29,488 --> 00:57:32,488
ステージの紹介をしたいなーって思います。
I'd like to give a tour of the stage set!

623
00:57:32,488 --> 00:57:34,588
まだまだあるよ！
There's still more!

624
00:57:34,588 --> 00:57:37,088
見てみて見て見て、これ！
Look, look, look, look at this!

625
00:57:37,088 --> 00:57:41,588
なんと前回よりもプレゼントが増えていまーす！
Believe it or not, there are even more presents than last time!

626
00:57:41,588 --> 00:57:42,888
どどーん！
Ta-da!

627
00:57:43,088 --> 00:57:46,588
ほらほらほら、何が入っているのかなっていうね、
Look, look, look! Wondering what's inside,

628
00:57:46,588 --> 00:57:49,088
形になっているのと、あと、
they're placed like this, and also...

629
00:57:49,088 --> 00:57:50,088
ここ！
Here!

630
00:57:50,088 --> 00:57:52,588
かにかまが！
Kanikama is...

631
00:57:52,588 --> 00:57:55,288
ちょっと変化してます！分かるでしょうか？
slightly changed! Can you tell?

632
00:57:55,288 --> 00:57:59,888
えーサイゼリヤの間違い探し、じゃないですけどね、
Uh, it's not like the Saizeriya spot-the-difference,

633
00:57:59,888 --> 00:58:02,888
微妙に変わっております！
but it's subtly changed!

634
00:58:02,888 --> 00:58:04,088
なんと！
Believe it or not,

635
00:58:04,088 --> 00:58:06,888
かにかまが増えています！
the Kanikamas have increased!

636
00:58:06,888 --> 00:58:08,888
気づいた？気づいたかな？
Did you notice? Did you notice?

637
00:58:08,888 --> 00:58:12,588
あとステージ全体はこうなっていまーす！
Also, the overall stage looks like this!

638
00:58:13,088 --> 00:58:17,588
おー！豪華ー！
Woah! So glamorous!

639
00:58:17,588 --> 00:58:22,588
すごいよね、キラキラ感も増しております！
Awesome, right? The sparkling effect has increased too!

640
00:58:22,588 --> 00:58:26,588
みんなも応援ありがとー！
Thank you everyone for your support!

641
00:58:26,588 --> 00:58:28,088
それからね、
And also...

642
00:58:28,088 --> 00:58:30,588
でっかいね、
this big...

643
