softer! Look, bouncing, bouncing!

660
00:59:22,088 --> 00:59:24,088
そうの！
That's right!

661
00:59:24,088 --> 00:59:27,588
やっぱりね、パトラはね、あの鉄脚のね、
After all, Patra has those iron legs...

662
00:59:27,588 --> 00:59:30,088
