Bye-bye!

675
01:00:00,096 --> 01:00:08,096
生誕祭ライブ終わりました！
The birthday celebration live has ended!

676
01:00:08,096 --> 01:00:18,096
つたない歌と豪華なステージで
On a gorgeous stage with my clumsy singing,

677
01:00:18,096 --> 01:00:28,096
はしゃぐパトが今年もできたのは あなたのおかげです。
it's all thanks to you that Patra could have so much fun again this year.

678
01:00:28,096 --> 01:00:38,096
今日もこの世界に生きててくれてありがとう！
Thank you for being alive in this world today!

679
01:00:38,096 --> 01:00:48,096
パトは今皆といることが一番楽しいです。
Being with everyone right now brings Patra the most joy.

680
01:00:48,096 --> 01:00:56,896
それはきっと世界で一番幸せなことです。
That is surely the happiest thing in the world.

681
